# fashionistas.ai routing
#
# Before 2026-09-29 this project shipped no 404.html, so Cloudflare Pages fell
# back to index.html for EVERY unmatched URL — /anything returned HTTP 200 with
# the homepage in the body (a soft-404). Shipping 404.html fixed that, but it
# also turned the aliases below into hard 404s.
#
# They are kept as real 301s so every URL that used to work keeps working:
# /app/ was listed in the sitemap until 2026-09-29, so search engines and
# anyone with the old link still land somewhere sensible.
/app   /   301
/app/  /   301
